  "publisher_appendix_scope_statements": [
    "The Code Reviser\u2019s Office annually publishes a list of exemptions from the Revised Code of Washington (RCW), which can be found on the Attorney General\u2019s Sunshine Committee page (scroll to bottom and click to expand \"Public Disclosure Exemptions\"). For a list of selected federal exemptions, see Appendix C of MRSC's PRA publication .",
    "Some agencies, like Prosser ( Municipal Code Sec. 1.30.060 ) and Port of Kingston ( PR Policy Appendix A ), publish their own list; others adopt by reference MRSC\u2019s list of exemptions found in Appendix C of MRSC's PRA publication . The Code Reviser\u2019s Office also annually publishes a list of exemptions contained in the RCW, which can be accessed on the Attorney General\u2019s Sunshine Committee webpage."
  ],
